    "How ready you are for the exam, from what you studied and how you answered." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the exam preparation number",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wie gut du auf die Prüfung vorbereitet bist – basierend auf deinen Lerninhalten und Antworten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu preparación para el examen según lo que has estudiado y tus respuestas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estimation de ta préparation à l’examen, d’après ce que tu as étudié et tes réponses."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seu preparo para a prova, com base no que você estudou e nas suas respostas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your next session" : {
      "comment" : "When the phase's challenge comes",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In deiner nächsten Lerneinheit"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En tu próxima sesión"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lors de ta prochaine séance"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na próxima sessão"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It leaves your goals and its plan stops. What you learned stays in your progress." : {
      "comment" : "Explains what archiving a goal does",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Ziel wird aus deinen Zielen entfernt und der Plan endet. Was du gelernt hast, bleibt in deinem Fortschritt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El objetivo desaparece de tus objetivos y su plan se detiene. Lo que has aprendido sigue en tu progreso."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’objectif disparaît de tes objectifs et son plan s’arrête. Ce que tu as appris reste dans ta progression."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ela sai das suas metas e o plano é interrompido. O que você aprendeu continua no seu progresso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It usually takes a minute or two. Your plan opens here as soon as it's ready." : {
      "comment" : "Explains that the plan appears on its own once it's built",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es dauert normalerweise ein bis zwei Minuten. Sobald dein Plan fertig ist, wird er hier angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suele tardar uno o dos minutos. Tu plan aparecerá aquí en cuanto esté listo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ça prend généralement une ou deux minutes. Ton plan s’affiche ici dès qu’il est prêt."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geralmente leva um ou dois minutos. Seu plano aparece aqui assim que fica pronto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's in your plan from your next study day. Today's session stays as it is." : {
      "comment" : "Says a change starts on the next study day",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ab deinem nächsten Lerntag ist die Änderung in deinem Plan. Die heutige Lerneinheit bleibt unverändert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aparecerá en tu plan a partir de tu próximo día de estudio. La sesión de hoy se mantiene como está."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "C’est dans ton plan à partir de ta prochaine journée d’étude. La séance d’aujourd’hui ne change pas."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A mudança entra no seu plano a partir do próximo dia de estudo. A sessão de hoje continua como está."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's in your plan, and today's session follows it." : {
      "comment" : "Says a change applies to today's session too",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
